'''Pigge''' (ブタヤロウ, ''Buta Yarō'', '''Bastard Pig''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Pigge
|image = E 004.png
|first appearance = '''EoC''': [[Maldives (Empire of Cats)|Chapter 1 - Maldives/Tokushima]]<br>
'''ItF''': [[China (Into the Future)|Chapter 1 - China]]<br>
'''CotC''': [[Saturn (Cats of the Cosmos)|Chapter 1 - Saturn]]<br>
'''SoL''': [[Gazpacho Highland|Sub-chapter 2 - Gazpacho Highland]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[After-Lunch Nap|Sub Chapter 14 - After-Lunch Nap]]
|money drop = 400¢ - 1580¢
}}

==Enemy==
Pigge has similar attributes to [[Hippoe]], but with 50% more health and 20% more damage. She is quicker in both speed and attack than previously encountered enemies.

==Strategy==
This is the second "boss enemy" fought in the game, similar to Hippoe. However, Red enemies are nothing more but opponents with a huge disadvantage this early in the game. To kill her easily, focus on [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]] like [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] or [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]]. [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and/or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] also work well against Pigge, as they can deal a lot of damage and have long range.

Later in the game, Pigge is nothing more than a meatshield for stronger enemies, like in [[Boiling Spring]] or [[Fainting Porch]], or even a free source of money. She can be taken out easily by almost any attacker.

