==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Pigge
|St. Pigge the 2nd
|A much bigger version of Pigge which usually replaces Pigge in [[Stories of Legend]]. Attacks faster, has high health and double the knockback count.
|Pigge Back
|3 [[Doge]]s holding up a Pigge. Has double the attack speed and range of Pigge, and higher health. First appears in the [[Autumn = Sports Day! (Monthly Event)|Autumn = Sports Day!]] event.
|Elizabeth the LVIth
|[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of St. Pigge the 2nd. She has much higher health, and 100% chance to create a level 3 [[Wave Attack]].
|Zigge
|[[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of Pigge. Has higher health and damage, is a little bit faster, and can knockback units. Like most Zombies, she can burrow past cats and revive once with 50% HP.
|Winged Pigge
|[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of St. Pigge the 2nd. Has much higher health and damage and an [[Omni Strike]] that reaches 340 range, moves faster, and weakens cats by 90% for 5 seconds.
|Pigge Victorious
|A variant of Pigge Back, the Pigge is now flipped upwards and she has a school jacket. Has even higher range and attack speed, with much higher stats. First appears in the [[FINALS WEEK#Go Go Graduates!|Go Go Graduates!]] event.
|Suidae Piggicus
|[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of Pigge, with very high health and a 20% chance to freeze cat units for 2 seconds. Unlike Elizabeth the LVIth, it doesn't create [[Wave Attack]]s.
|Malizabeth
|[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of Pigge from the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]], with a far higher attack rate, DPS and health, but only a single knockback. She also has a 30% chance to generate a level 2 Mini-Wave, as well as a weak [[Shield]].
}}

