==Trivia==
*Since her Japanese description says she was born in England, Pigge may be based on the [[wikipedia:Tamworth pig|Tamworth]], a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]-colored British breed of domestic pig.
*Pigge's name in the [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|original English version]] was "Elizabitch". This references her Japanese description, which states her real name is Elizabeth and that she was given a nickname that she doesn't admit.
**This theme is later carried on with [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]'s royal motif (named Elizabeth II in Japanese), [[Zigge]]'s description's references to her being a past monarch, and in [[Elizabeth the LVIth]], who not only has the royal motif of St. Pigge the 2nd, but is even named Elizabeth in English.
*St. Pigge the 2nd is Pigge's ancestor.
*[[Raynard]]'s Japanese description states that his clothes were made from Pigge's skin in an effort to hide incriminating evidence after he mistakenly hit her with a [[Surge Attack]].
*In the English [[media:Crazed moneko full img01 en.jpg|banner]] for the [[Crazed Moneko]] event, Pigge is referred to as "Red Pigge".

